(sorry if this has come up before...)

A couple of changes that I would like to see in the use interface: when
presented with questions like

  Would you like to take something out of the chest? [yn]

I would like to see the default option first.  It's not a big deal - there
aren't very many such situtations in the game, after all, so I usually know
what the default is - but it is annoying, and I can't think of any reason not
to do it this way.  Also, when I am picking up items, and select 'A' when asked
what kind of objects I want to pick up, if I select 'a' while picking up it
only picks up the rest of the items of the current class of items.  (Did that
make sense?  I hope so.)  This is annoying, since if there are (e.g.) a corpse,
a food ration, and a lot of weapons in the pile, then I would like to be able
to select 'A' when asked what I want to pick up, 'n' for the corpse, and 'a'
for the food ration, getting all of the weapons as well.  If i didn't want to
pick up the weapons, I would have just typed '%' instead of 'A'.

